{"id":"79d768f9ea7e6c87","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-savitch-reachability.md","title":"Savitch折半可达性递归","display":"df-savitch-reachability — Savitch折半可达性递归","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-savitch-reachability","aliases":["28-df-savitch-reachability"],"display":"df-savitch-reachability — Savitch折半可达性递归","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 4.14 and proof","source_printed_pages":"85–86","source_pdf_pages":"111–112","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-savitch-reachability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-savitch-reachability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-savitch-reachability — Savitch折半可达性递归"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 4.14 and proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"85–86"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"111–112"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,E)\">\\(G=(V,E)\\)</span> 是有限有向图，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq V\\times V\">\\(E\\subseteq V\\times V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v,w\\in V\">\\(u,v,w\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_G\">\\(R_G\\)</span> 是在第三参数上递归构造的布尔关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_G(u,v,0)\\Longleftrightarrow(u=v\\lor(u,v)\\in E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_G(u,v,0)\\Longleftrightarrow(u=v\\lor(u,v)\\in E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_G(u,v,j+1)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists w\\in V\\;\\left[R_G(u,w,j)\\land R_G(w,v,j)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_G(u,v,j+1)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists w\\in V\\;\\left[R_G(u,w,j)\\land R_G(w,v,j)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>基例允许长度0或1；第j层恰检验存在至多2^j步路径。长路径在中点分成两段；短路径可以取端点分割而无需自环。递归仅调用较小自然数，故唯一良定义；深度O(log|V|)，逐层枚举中点的方式导致Savitch空间平方界。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 4.14 and proof；印刷 pp.85–86 / PDF pp.111–112。本次核对范围：定义陈述与本地形式化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,E)","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq V\\times V","display":false},{"tex":"u,v,w\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"R_G","display":false},{"tex":"R_G(u,v,0)\\Longleftrightarrow(u=v\\lor(u,v)\\in E).","display":true},{"tex":"R_G(u,v,j+1)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists w\\in V\\;\\left[R_G(u,w,j)\\land R_G(w,v,j)\\right].","display":true}],"bytes":1426,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-288","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-conl]]、[[28-prop-nl-contained-p]]、[[28-cor-l-strict-pspace]]、[[28-df-savitch-reachability]]、[[28-prop-finite-reachability-bound]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}